{"ref":"BDB, חוּם","hw":"חוּם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חוּם</span></big>  <strong>adj. darkened, dark brown</strong> or <strong>black</strong>, only of colour of sheep (in <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30\" href=\"/Genesis.30\">Gn 30</a>, J);—<span dir=\"rtl\">וכל־שֶׂה־חוּם בכשׂבים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:32\" href=\"/Genesis.30.32\">Gn 30:32</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחוּם בכ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:33\" href=\"/Genesis.30.33\">Gn 30:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">35</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וכל־חוּם בְּצֹאן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:40\" href=\"/Genesis.30.40\">Gn 30:40</a> (cl. prob. interpol. Ol Hup De We Di).","next":"BDB, חוֹמָה","prev":"BDB, חום"}